s", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 1}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1510802093", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2022#issuecomment-1510802093", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2022", "id": 1510802093, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5aDQKt", "user": {"login": "kousheekc", "id": 25120991, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTIwOTkx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25120991?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc", "html_url": "https://github.com/kousheekc", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kousheekc/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-04-17T06:55:43Z", "updated_at": "2023-04-17T06:55:43Z", "body": "Hello thanks for the reply, unfortunately adding the baudrate did not solve the problem. I believe according to the documentation, if no baudrate is specified it defaults to 57600, which is the baudrate set on my pixhawk.\r\n\r\nAlso as I mentioned earlier, this same code functions correctly when I use it in a pure C++ console app, the problem occurs when I try using it in a UWP C++/CX app. I have attached below the context in which I am using it: it is in the constructor of the MainPage and I am using a switch case on the connection_result along with a message dialog box in UWP to determine which is the error. This results in a ConnectionError each time.\r\n\r\n```\r\nMainPage::MainPage()\r\n{\r\n    InitializeComponent();\r\n\r\n    mavsdk::Mavsdk m_Mavsdk;\r\n    mavsdk::ConnectionResult connection_result = m_Mavsdk.add_any_connection(\"serial://COM7:57600\");\r\n\r\n    MessageDialog^ msg;\r\n\r\n    switch (connection_result)\r\n    {\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::Success:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"Success\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::Timeout:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"Timeout\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::SocketError:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"SocketError\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::BindError:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"BindError\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::SocketConnectionError:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"SocketConnectionError\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::ConnectionError:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"ConnectionError\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::NotImplemented:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"NotImplemented\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::SystemNotConnected:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"SystemNotConnected\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::SystemBusy:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"SystemBusy\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::CommandDenied:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"CommandDenied\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::DestinationIpUnknown:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"DestinationIpUnknown\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::ConnectionsExhausted:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"ConnectionsExhausted\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::ConnectionUrlInvalid:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"ConnectionUrlInvalid\");\r\n        break;\r\n    case mavsdk::ConnectionResult::BaudrateUnknown:\r\n        msg = ref new MessageDialog(\"BaudrateUnknown\");\r\n        break;\r\n    default:\r\n        break;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    msg->ShowAsync();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nFinally, what do you mean by the parse error? Isn't the function **add_any_connection** responsible for basically checking whether the specified URL exists?\r\n\r\nThank you so much once again.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1510802093/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1510804739", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2022#issuecomment-1510804739", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2022", "id": 1510804739, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5aDQ0D", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "rep